1
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,120
All set here for you.
您这办好了

2
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,520
- Great, thank you.
- Next, please.
-好，谢谢
-来，下一位

3
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:21,720
Let's go.
走了

4
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,360
Applying for retirement.
办退休

5
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,520
Let me check your paperwork.
材料看一下

6
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,560
Did you bring your healthcare book?
保健本带了吗？

7
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,880
Your paperwork is incomplete.
您这个材料不齐呀

8
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:39,680
Why?
为啥？

9
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,640
This book is missing a stamp.
您这本上缺了个章

10
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,400
You need to get this stamp added.
您得把这个章补上

11
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,920
Our factory shut down years ago.
我们厂没多少年了

12
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,400
Where am I supposed to find someone to stamp it now?
我这不是找不着人盖这个章吗？

13
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:51,360
Just... just count the years.
您…您算算时间

14
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:54,120
Really... I've worked the full 30 years.
我真的…我够30年工龄了

15
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:57,840
Your situation is indeed quite unusual.
您这个情况确实比较特殊

16
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:00,840
Can you still contact Zhao Guangzhou, the agent from your old company?
您现在还能联系上 你们原单位的这个经办人赵广州吗？

17
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,800
Our factory's been gone for years.
我们厂子都没多少年了

18
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:05,880
I don't even know why he didn't stamp it back then.
我也不知道 他当时为啥不给我盖这个章

19
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,680
Where am I supposed to go find him now?
我现在上哪找他去呀？

20
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,680
Tell me, where am I supposed to find him?
你说我上哪找他去

21
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,840
What's wrong, Qiaoyun?
怎么的了，巧云？

22
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:11,880
What happened?
怎么的了？

23
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,480
Don't cry...
不哭…

24
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,880
I'm right here now.
我不过来了吗？

25
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,160
Let's talk this through calmly.
有话咱们好好说

26
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,920
I... I started at Hualin Steel on October 1st, 1986.
我…我1986年10月1号进的桦钢

27
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,600
I worked at the scale house operating the weighbridge.
在磅房管过磅

28
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:28,000
I left the plant on October 4th, 1998.
我1998年10月4号离的厂

29
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:30,640
I worked at Hualin Steel for 12 whole years.
我在桦钢整整工作了12年

30
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,840
In those 12 years, I didn't take a single day off.
这12年里面，我没有请过一天假

31
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:36,560
Why do I need someone else to prove now that I worked at Hualin Steel?
为什么现在还要让别的人来证明 我在桦钢工作过？

32
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:38,240
People reach their age, buses reach their stop.
人到岁数，车到站

33
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,840
We came here to file for retirement.
我们过来办退休

34
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,360
You keep giving us this excuse and that excuse.
你们这个那个，那个这个

35
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:42,360
What are you trying to pull?
想怎么的？

36
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,800
Don't worry, sir.
您别着急，大爷

37
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,960
We'll double-check her length of service again.
工龄的事我们再去核实一下

38
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:48,320
This won't affect her retiring on schedule.
这个事不会影响阿姨正常退休的

39
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,400
Rest assured.
您放心

40
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,520
Go on home first.
先回家

41
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,800
Here.
来

42
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,880
It's open. Eat up.
来了，吃吧

43
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:08,360
- Why did you spend money on this?
- Don't worry, eat up.
-你这…你花钱买这个干啥啊？
-没事，吃吧

44
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:11,360
You always say your heart feels bitter, so treat yourself to something sweet.
妳老说自己心里苦，整点甜的

45
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:13,360
My teeth can't take it anymore.
牙不行了

46
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,320
Nonsense.
妳净扯

47
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,120
If my teeth can manage, how can't yours?
我牙都行，妳牙还不行？

48
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,120
Eat.
吃

49
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,040
How... how do you open this?
这…这怎么开呢？

50
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,440
Don't rush.
先别着急啊

51
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,600
Take it easy.
稳当的

52
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,480
See this notch right here?
妳看这不有豁吗？

53
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,400
Pull right here.
撕这个

54
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,240
There you go.
妥了

55
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,920
Eat.
吃

56
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,640
I just feel so aggrieved.
我就是觉得憋屈

57
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:39,440
Laid off when I was so young.
年纪轻轻的就下岗了

58
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,040
Failed at everything since then.
干啥啥不成

59
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,240
At your age...
你这岁数的人了

60
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:45,680
...making a big scene and crying over this.
还因为这些个事又哭又闹的

61
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:48,520
Tell me, when will life ever get better?
你说这日子啥时候是个头啊？

62
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,120
It's alright.
没事

63
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,760
This will definitely get sorted out.
这事肯定能解决

64
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,600
Didn't they explain it to us just now?
人家不也给咱解释了吗？

65
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,880
Don't worry about it.
妳就踏实的吧

66
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,400
I keep causing trouble for you.
我这净给你添麻烦了

67
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,800
I wasted your driving time for making money.
耽误你出车挣钱了

68
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,320
Stop talking nonsense.
净扯用不着的

69
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,520
What waste?
耽误啥呀？

70
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,120
It's no trouble at all.
不耽误

71
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:09,520
Actually, there's something I wanted to ask you.
我正好有个事想问妳呢

72
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,680
What is it?
啥事？

73
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,760
Asking about someone.
跟妳打听个人

74
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:18,560
Didn't you use to work at Victoria back then?
以前妳不是 在那个维多利亚工作过吗？

75
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,240
Victoria, you know.
就是维多利亚

76
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:23,560
Victoria Entertainment Plaza.
娱乐广场

77
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,480
What do you mean by that?
你啥意思啊？

78
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,600
Just asking you about a person.
就是跟妳打听那个人啊

79
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,360
The girl who played the piano.
就是那个弹钢琴的

80
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,600
Named Shen Mo.
叫沈墨的

81
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,240
Were you close with her?
妳跟她熟不熟？

82
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:44,120
We crossed paths, but weren't close.
打过照面，不熟

83
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,760
She had a brother named Fu Weijun who's mute.
那她有个弟弟叫傅卫军，是个哑巴

84
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,960
Did you know about him?
妳知道不？

85
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,840
No recollection.
没印象

86
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,480
Help me think back.
妳帮我回忆回忆吧

87
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,440
Did you ever see that guy at Victoria back then?
妳当时在维多利亚见过这人没有啊？

88
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,320
I forgot all about those days. I...
那段我早就忘了，我这…

89
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,960
I can barely remember anything about Victoria.
维多利亚啥的我都记不清了

90
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,520
Take... take your time. No rush.
妳…妳帮我，妳不着急

91
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,080
Just try to think back slowly for me.
妳帮我慢慢想一想

92
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:08,600
Around 1997 or 1998.
就是1997、1998这两年的事

93
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,480
Wang Xiang.
王响

94
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:16,080
Has this been bothering you in your heart all along?
你是不是一直因为这个事 心里不痛快的？

95
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,480
I worked as a hostess.
我做过陪酒

96
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,960
If that makes you uncomfortable, just say so.
你要是不舒服，你就直说

97
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:26,320
Qiaoyun, I...
巧云，我…

98
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,840
Why would I be uncomfortable?
我不舒服啥呀？

99
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,120
I... I never even thought of it that way.
我…我压根…我都没往这上想过

100
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,560
Why would I... be uncomfortable?
我还…我还不舒服？

101
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,320
I've told you everything you asked.
你问我的事我都告诉你了

102
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,920
I don't know anything else.
再多我也不知道了

103
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,960
Fine... I'll head back on my own.
行了…我自己回去了

104
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,960
You eat it.
你吃吧

105
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,320
- I'm heading back.
- Wait, why?
-我回去了
-干啥？

106
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,400
Take it with you then.
那妳带着吃吧

107
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,280
It's too sweet, I can't eat it.
太甜，我吃不下

108
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,760
Then... let me give you a ride...
那…那我送妳…

109
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:49,760
No need...
不用…

110
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:50,960
I'll walk myself.
我自己走

111
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:57,800
What's going on with you? This got completely misunderstood.
妳这扯不扯？ 澈底整岔去了

112
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,400
This is a total misunderstanding.
这误会了这是

113
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,840
What a waste.
这浪费了

114
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:41,280
Next time you're free, let's grab some drinks.
等那个有空，到时候整点

115
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,960
Deal... I'll hit you up then.
成…到时候我约你啊

116
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,160
What's up? You took up dancing now?
怎么的？ 还跳上了？

117
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:52,000
Did that kid admit to hitting the person?
这小子承认他撞人这事了吧？

118
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,800
Well, the car is his, so he can't wriggle out of it.
反正车是他的，跑不了

119
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:58,240
But when it happened, where it happened, and who got hit...
但啥时间撞的 在啥地方撞的，撞的是谁

120
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,200
...even he can't explain clearly.
自己都说不清楚

121
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:03,280
Plus, the person who got hit hasn't reported it either.
这被撞那个人也不报案

122
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,960
Making it pretty tough to investigate.
这个事查起来有点困难

123
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,880
They can't share any more details.
其他的人家没法说了

124
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,120
We understand how it is.
这咱明白

125
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,400
Anything more would be breaking protocol.
再说属于违规

126
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,240
So slick.
真狡猾

127
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,280
What's the deal?
怎么的呀？

128
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,720
Isn't it just a simple hit-and-run?
不就一肇事逃逸吗？

129
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,200
Why are you so obsessed with it?
怎么这么上心呢？

130
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,200
You wouldn't understand.
你不懂

131
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:26,560
There's a story behind it, huh?
有故事吧

132
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,520
Or maybe it's just an accident.
那兴许就是个事故

133
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,880
Want one?
给你来一个不？

134
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,400
I'm telling you, I quit smoking.
我告诉你啊，我是把烟给戒了

135
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,680
But my mouth always feels so bland.
这嘴里老没味

136
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,560
Does this guy look familiar?
你看这人眼熟不？

137
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,120
Who is it?
谁呀？

138
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,560
The Hualin Medical University student.
桦医大学生

139
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,720
Don't you remember the dismemberment case?
碎尸案你不记得了？

140
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,320
Wasn't it this punk I beat up?
我干的不就这小子吗？

141
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,200
Isn't this her uncle?
这她那大爷吧

142
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,640
You beat him up real good back then.
你给人揍的，揍够呛

143
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:56,880
It wore me out, too.
我还累够呛呢

144
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,640
What was he doing here?
他来这干啥来了？

145
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,640
Maybe there really is a story here.
兴许这里头还真有故事

146
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,840
What kind of story?
有啥故事啊？

147
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,760
What's the hit-and-run kid named?
撞人那小子叫啥？

148
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,080
Shen Hui.
沉辉呀

149
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,200
- What about it?
- You sure?
-怎么的？
-准确吗？

150
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,200
Absolutely sure.
准确啊

151
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,560
Li Qun.
李群

152
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,840
Are you still in touch with him?
你还跟他有联系吗？

153
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,320
You held your breath all this time just to ask that?
憋了半天就问这个

154
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:31,640
Why would I be in touch with him?
我跟他联系啥？

155
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,200
He's a branch bureau chief now.
他都分局局长了

156
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,200
Out of my league.
咱也够不上啊

157
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,480
Listen to how bitter you sound.
你看你酸的

158
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,280
Look at yourself.
没看你这啥德行

159
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,640
A traffic cop with such a gloomy face.
一交警，脸这黑呢

160
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,240
Got plans tonight?
晚上有事吗？

161
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:45,280
Do you want me to have plans or not?
你是想让我有事啊，还是没事啊？

162
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,160
Let me buy you a nice meal.
我给你补补吧

163
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,120
Did you drive here?
开车没有啊？

164
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,120
No, do you have a ride?
没开呀，你有车呀

165
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,160
Hop on mine.
坐我车

166
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,360
There we go.
这不完了吗？

167
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,280
When did you get a new ride?
啥时候换的车呀？

168
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,760
Brand new?
新买的啊？

169
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,360
Don't touch that.
别弄

170
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,720
Hey, why are you messing with his ride?
不是，你动人车干啥呀？

171
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,600
A two-wheeler?
两轮的呀？

172
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,200
What's wrong with two wheels?
两轮怎么的？

173
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,760
Put on the helmet, quick.
赶紧的，拿着盔

174
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,120
This color actually suits me pretty well.
这颜色还挺适合我的

175
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,520
Right? Wearing pink makes you look vibrant.
可不？ 你戴粉的显得鲜亮

176
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,200
Sit back here?
坐这啊？

177
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,360
Hold on tight.
抱住了啊

178
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,320
Don't underestimate these two wheels.
别看这两轮

179
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,560
Faster than four.
比四轮快

180
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,520
Where do I put my feet?
踩哪呀？

181
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Just drag 'em.
拖着吧

182
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:35,160
(Guiying's Flavorful BBQ)
（桂英风味烤肉）

183
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,280
It's hot.
热

184
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,200
Should we two just start eating first?
不行咱俩先吃吧？

185
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,760
Look what time it is.
这都几点了？

186
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,840
Is he even coming?
还能来吗？

187
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,400
I called him, would he dare not show up?
我叫他，他敢不来吗？

188
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,840
Are you hungry?
是不是饿了？

189
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,120
Drink some water.
喝水

190
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,040
Other people roast meat.
人家烤肉

191
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:15,280
We're sitting here burning charcoal.
咱俩在这烧炭

192
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,640
Looking like we're committing suicide.
整得跟自杀似的

193
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:20,560
How about I pay, okay?
要不行我请，成吗？

194
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,360
Yapping on and on...
叭叭…叭叭的

195
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,640
Will you give it a rest? We're on serious business here.
有完没完？ 这干正事呢

196
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,960
Are you that desperate for a meal?
你欠这顿饭呢？

197
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,880
Hey, I did all the work for you.
那不是事都给你干了

198
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,600
- Look at you.
- Why are you still the same as before?
-你看你
-怎么还原来那样呢？

199
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,040
Fine... can I go outside for a breath of fresh air then?
行…那我出去喘口气行吗？

200
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,000
Keep an eye out for him!
看着点人啊

201
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,360
Uncle.
叔

202
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,520
Should I put out the fire for you first?
我要不先把火给你灭了吧？

203
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,480
No need, aren't we sitting right here?
不用，不是人在这吗？

204
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:53,760
Just preheating.
先预个热

205
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,280
He'll be here in a minute.
一会人就来了

206
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:58,680
It's just I'm worried it'll burn out our grill.
主要我怕把我们家烧烤架给烧坏了

207
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,360
Are you Guiying?
妳是桂英吗？

208
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:03,040
If you're not Guiying, call Guiying over.
不是桂英，让桂英过来

209
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,200
What's your problem?
怎么的？

210
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:08,120
Upset over burning a little charcoal?
点点炭不乐意了？

211
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,520
Would I just burn charcoal without ordering meat?
我光点炭不点肉啊？

212
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:11,880
Is this how you run a business?
这怎么做生意呢？

213
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,520
Is your grill made of plastic?
妳家烧烤架是塑料做的

214
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,520
You're forcing me to lecture you, aren't you?
非让我說妳是不？

215
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,880
Kids these days...
这小姑娘

216
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,120
Chief Li.
李局

217
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,240
Captain Ma.
马队

218
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,200
My apologies.
不好意思啊

219
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:41,000
Got tied up with something urgent at the bureau.
刚才局里有点事，脱不开身

220
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,480
Of course you're busy, right?
你肯定忙啊，对不？

221
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:44,880
Not like us common folks.
不像我们老百姓

222
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,960
Nothing better to do.
闲得没事干

223
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,640
Come on, why say that?
你这话说哪去了？

224
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:52,120
It's all serving the people, just busywork.
也都是为人民群众服务，瞎忙

225
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,200
Look at you, look at your presence now.
你看你，你看现在这个派头

226
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:56,040
Really got the air of a bureau chief.
真有点局长那样了啊

227
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,400
Captain Ma.
马队啊

228
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,480
How come your hair's all white?
怎么头发都白了呀？

229
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:01,720
Still calling me Captain Ma?
还马队呢？

230
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,280
Old Ma.
老马

231
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:07,120
Waiter, menu please.
服务生，来，点菜

232
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,720
Scan QR code to order.
扫码点餐

233
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,680
Scan code? Talk about lazy.
扫码？ 这偷懒

234
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,240
Let me do it.
我来吧

235
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,280
How do you scan it?
怎么扫啊？

236
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,400
Let me...
我来…

237
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,280
- Let me handle it...
- What "let me, let me"?
-我来…
-什么你来你来的？

238
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,840
- I'll scan it.
- Can't I treat you to a meal?
-我来扫
-我还不能请你吃个饭呢？

239
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,120
- Why insist on...
- Alright...
-怎么还就…
-行了…

240
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,280
You're the guest of honor today.
请的就是你

241
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:22,080
- Alright, stop squabbling, Old Ma.
- Let me... my treat...
-行了，别拉扯，老马
-我来…我请…

242
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,000
Fine, go ahead.
行，你来吧

243
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,280
I'll just order randomly.
我随便点啊

244
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:36,160
Beef, pork belly, grilled chicken hearts...
牛肉、五花肉、烤鸡心

245
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,400
How many years has it been since we last met?
咱俩多少年没见了？

246
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:54,720
I heard you're doing great at square dancing these days.
我听人家说你现在广场舞跳挺好啊

247
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,520
What square dancing? Who's spreading nonsense?
什么广场舞？ 听谁胡说呢？

248
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,360
Latin dance, you know?
拉丁，你知道吧？

249
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,640
It's pure style.
就是帅

250
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:02,080
I'm the coolest guy in the world.
全世界我最帅

251
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:03,760
Latin dance...
拉丁…

252
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,000
Drink some water.
喝水

253
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,440
- There's...
- Waiter!
-这有…
-服务员

254
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,080
No cups here.
没有杯子

255
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,960
Do we have to scan a code for cups too?
这杯子也扫码啊？

256
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,480
Old Ma.
老马

257
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,360
Anyone else coming?
还有谁呀？

258
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,600
Your skewers smell fantastic.
你这小味挺绝啊

259
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:31,520
How many years have you been grilling?
烤多少年了？

260
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,760
Five or six years, big brother.
五、六年了，大哥

261
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,800
Is that so?
是吗？

262
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,680
Rush my ten skewers a bit, I'm in a hurry.
我那十串稍微快点，着急啊

263
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:38,720
You got it!
好咧

264
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,240
Where's your chili powder?
你辣椒在哪呢？

265
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,320
Right here.
搁这呢

266
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:45,840
Sprinkle extra.
多撒点

267
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,280
My chili powder is extra spicy.
我这辣椒可辣呀

268
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:50,080
Don't worry, he's from Sichuan.
没事，他是四川的

269
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:01,560
Here you go...
来呀…

270
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:03,480
All ready, enjoy.
这好了，来

271
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,040
What's wrong?
怎么了？

272
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,560
Look at Mr. Bureau Chief.
这局长当的

273
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:09,680
No one serving food onto your plate, so you forgot how to eat?
没人给夹菜，不会吃饭了？

274
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:14,120
Why am I so glad to see you?
我见你怎么那么高兴呢？

275
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,880
Eat up.
吃啊

276
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,400
Earlier you kept complaining you were starving.
刚才饿饿饿的

277
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,400
From waiting so long.
等的

278
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,320
I'm past being hungry.
饿过劲了

279
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:24,800
Come on... let's have a drink.
来…那喝酒

280
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,600
- Cheers.
- Cheers.
-来
-来

281
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,320
Let me pour for Chief Li.
我给李局倒上

282
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,600
Can't drink...
不能喝…

283
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:32,560
Regulations prohibit it.
有规定

284
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,600
Aren't you off the clock?
这不下班了吗？

285
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,080
Who here hasn't been a cop?
谁没当过警察呀？

286
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,360
- Come on...
- Old Ma.
-来吧…
-老马

287
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,480
- Be understanding...
- Come on.
-多体谅…
-来吧

288
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,560
Really can't drink, can't do it.
真不能喝，不能喝

289
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:46,520
Captain Ma, it's understandable.
马队，能理解

290
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,280
He's Chief Li now.
人家现在是李局了

291
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:51,080
Not like us. Be more understanding.
跟咱们不一样，多体谅

292
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,920
Why so full of snide remarks? What's your problem?
说话夹枪带棒的，干嘛呢？

293
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,760
Then I... come on...
那我…来…

294
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,840
I'll drink with you, cheers.
我跟你喝，来

295
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:56,960
What are you doing?
你要干嘛呀？

296
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:58,200
Aren't you riding a scooter?
你不是骑着车吗？

297
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,480
Aren't you afraid of getting pulled over by cops?
不怕警察逮你呀？

298
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:01,520
And you're a traffic cop yourself?
还交警呢还？

299
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,560
Have some meat.
烤肉

300
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,360
To be honest...
说实话啊

301
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:08,000
Meeting old leaders and colleagues today...
今天能见着老领导、老同事…

302
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,280
- My mood...
- Chicken gizzards!
-心情…
-鸡胗

303
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,160
...I feel truly delighted.
我这心情是愉悦的

304
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,760
Tell you what.
这样

305
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:16,920
I'll toast with tea instead of alcohol, fair?
我以茶代酒，行不？

306
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:19,920
Is that alright?
可以吗？

307
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:21,680
Um... Li Qun.
那个…李群

308
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,160
Let me interrupt you for a second.
我先插你一句啊

309
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,160
If we're talking about opening remarks...
要说开场

310
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:27,400
...it has to be Captain Ma.
还得是马队

311
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:28,640
What do you think?
你觉得呢？

312
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:35,120
Me, opening remarks?
我开场啊？

313
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,360
Then I'll say a few words.
那我开场吧

314
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,720
We're all brothers here.
都是兄弟

315
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:53,640
Old Ma.
老马

316
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,720
Did you ask me out because something's up?
找我是不是有啥事啊？

317
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:58,160
If there's something, just speak plainly.
有啥事你直说得了

318
00:16:58,640 --> 00:16:59,680
Really nothing.
真没啥事

319
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,080
What could there be?
能有啥事？

320
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:02,840
Can't a simple dinner just be a dinner?
你吃个饭还吃出事来了？

321
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:06,360
As long as it's reasonable...
只要合情合理

322
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,640
...I won't drag my feet if I can help.
能办我肯定不拖着

323
00:17:14,320 --> 00:17:15,640
Then I'll speak up.
那我就说啊

324
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:21,440
Back then, didn't you interrogate Fu Weijun in his case?
当年傅卫军这案子不是你审的吗？

325
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,520
Old Ma.
老马

326
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,480
I was young and impetuous back then.
当年我是年轻气盛

327
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,479
To be honest, in my heart...
说实话这个事在我心里

328
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,160
...I've never truly gotten over it.
我到现在都没过去

329
00:17:33,439 --> 00:17:34,640
That's not what I'm referring to.
说的不是这事

330
00:17:35,199 --> 00:17:37,080
It's fine, it's really nothing.
我说没事，没事吧

331
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:39,120
Back then in Songhe, Fu Weijun...
这傅卫军当时在松河

332
00:17:39,199 --> 00:17:41,280
...didn't he have an intentional assault charge?
不是有一个故意伤害吗？

333
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:42,560
You should know about it.
你应该知道啊

334
00:17:43,199 --> 00:17:44,040
I know.
我知道

335
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,800
Fu Weijun broke someone's arm back in Songhe.
傅卫军当时在松河把人胳膊给砸折了

336
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,840
It was already combined into his prison sentence back then.
当年就已经合并执行在刑期了

337
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,560
Sui Dong, who was with him, got sentenced too.
跟他一起那个隋东也判了

338
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,920
What are you trying to say?
你想说啥呀？

339
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,640
This kid is named Shen Hui.
这小子叫沉辉

340
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,640
Now he drives an illegal taxi in Hualin.
在桦林现在开黑车

341
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:58,760
A few days ago...
前几天

342
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:00,960
...he got detained for a hit-and-run with cloned plates.
套牌肇事给拘了

343
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:03,480
The victim he hit never reported it to police.
被他撞的这人一直没报警

344
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:04,840
And we can't locate the person now.
现在人也找不着

345
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:07,880
I called the prison.
我给这监狱打过电话

346
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:12,800
I found out Fu Weijun died in prison earlier this month.
我就了解到这傅卫军 在这个月初就死在这监狱里了

347
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,480
Is there any connection between these two things?
这两个事情有啥联系吗？

348
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:17,280
I don't know what connection there is, either.
我就是不知道有啥联系

349
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:20,200
I need to take a look at the 1998 case files.
我得看看这1998年这案子的卷宗

350
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:22,720
Come on...
来…

351
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:23,800
Come on.
来

352
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,480
Here.
来

353
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:27,600
This matter...
这个事

354
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:30,120
...you've got to help me with.
你得帮我啊

355
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,320
Old Ma.
老马

356
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:40,320
I know you haven't moved on from this case.
我知道这个案子你没过去

357
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:43,520
Just like me—I haven't moved on either.
咱俩一样，我也没过去

358
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:48,200
But non-police personnel cannot access these case files.
但是非警务人员不能接触这个卷宗

359
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:49,240
You know how it works.
这你懂

360
00:18:49,320 --> 00:18:51,040
If you get any leads in the future...
我希望以后有什么线索

361
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:52,840
...I hope you can provide them directly to the police.
你可以直接提供给警方

362
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:55,840
Leave the actual legwork to us officers.
动手的事交给我们警察就行了

363
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:57,960
Look at him.
你瞅瞅

364
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,640
Laying on the official jargon.
小官腔打的

365
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:03,880
Really treating me like ordinary civilian folk.
还真把我当人民群众了

366
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,840
I was playing this routine 20 years ago.
就你这套，我20年前就玩过了

367
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:11,240
Back when I was captain, you kid...
我是队长的时候，你小子…

368
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,560
Just tell me straight, will you help or not?
你就说帮不帮吧

369
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:19,600
We're done for.
完了

370
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:24,520
Anything else is fine.
别的都可以

371
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,600
But viewing the files...
但是看卷宗

372
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:27,520
...is out of the question.
不行

373
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,400
It violates regulations.
违反纪律

374
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:32,880
Li Qun.
李群

375
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,120
This matter is very important to me.
这件事对我很重要

376
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:37,000
This matter is very important to me, too.
这事对我也很重要

377
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,680
- Let me drop this.
- Stop talking about it.
-这事就别聊
-别聊了

378
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:49,720
Eat up...
吃…

379
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:50,640
Eat it all.
都吃了

380
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,400
Right, eat some meat...
对，吃肉…

381
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:54,200
Don't let good food go to waste.
不能耽误了饭呀

382
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:55,480
Here, Chief Li.
来，李局

383
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,760
These are skewers I specially ordered outside.
这是我在外边特意点的串

384
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:58,920
Give 'em a try.
尝尝

385
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,640
Give me one.
给我一个

386
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:03,320
I'm afraid of tough meat.
我怕老

387
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:07,280
Have something tender.
吃点嫩的

388
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,680
The Hualin Steel dismemberment case files have been pulled.
桦钢碎尸案的卷宗已经调出来了

389
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:16,400
Shen Hui is at the police station now.
沉辉现在在派出所

390
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,360
Interrogation starts right away.
马上提审

391
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:18,480
They're already on it.
已经去了

392
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,040
Surveillance footage of the hit-and-run has been retrieved too.
肇事逃逸的监控也已经拿到了

393
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:22,920
Everyone's present.
人都到齐了

394
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:30,880
Captain Ma.
马队啊

395
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:33,280
Not to rain on your parade...
不是我打击你啊

396
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,200
...how are you even going to piece this case together?
你这案子怎么捋啊？

397
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,920
The guy is dead. Who are you going to ask?
人都死了，你问谁去？

398
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:47,280
Prison No. 2 is in Fengshan District, right?
那二监是凤山区吧？

399
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:48,280
Yeah.
对呀

400
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:49,880
Then...
那…

401
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:51,600
When an inmate at Prison No. 2 dies...
二监那犯人死了

402
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:52,920
...where do they cremate them?
在哪火化呀？

403
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,680
Probably Fengshan Funeral Home.
凤山殡仪馆吧

404
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:00,160
(Hualin Fengshan Funeral Home)
（桦林凤山殡仪馆）

405
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:02,160
Your staff works way too carelessly.
你们这工作也太不严谨了

406
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:05,240
How could you even misplace an urn?
这骨灰盒都能给整没了

407
00:21:05,320 --> 00:21:06,320
Exactly!
就是啊

408
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:08,600
Weijun was our close relative.
那卫军是咱实在亲戚

409
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,160
Just because he committed a crime...
妳不能说人犯错误了

410
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,480
...you can't leave not even a handful of his ashes!
那灰也不给留一把啊

411
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:12,560
What kind of operation is this?
什么玩意？

412
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,760
No smoking allowed here. Fire prohibited.
这不让抽烟，禁止烟火

413
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:17,480
You ignore all those people burning joss paper outside.
外面那么多烧纸的妳不管

414
00:21:17,560 --> 00:21:19,280
Doesn't that big smokestack outside puff smoke every day?
那外面大烟囱不天天冒烟吗？

415
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:20,400
And you talk about prohibiting fire?
还禁止烟火？

416
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:22,680
Stop nagging me here!
你们别跟我在这啰唆了啊

417
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,280
Can ashes just be picked up by anyone?
骨灰是能随便领走的吗？

418
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:26,480
Whoever took them definitely went through standard procedures.
那能领走的，走的肯定是正常程序啊

419
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:29,360
You don't even know who took them, and you call that standard?
谁领走都不知道，还正常呢？

420
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:31,760
Help us check who claimed them.
帮我们查查吧，谁领走的

421
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:33,320
Just tell us, and that'll be that.
告诉我们一嘴不就完了吗？

422
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:34,880
You don't have any ID or proof of identity.
你们啥身分证明都没有

423
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:35,880
How can I check for you?
怎么给你们查？

424
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,360
No proof of identity?
我们没身分？

425
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,200
This is a retired police officer!
这是退休的公安干警

426
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:43,520
Former Captain of Criminal Investigation, Hualin Public Security!
桦林市公安局老刑警队队长

427
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:45,280
Captain Ma, show her your retirement badge.
马队，退休证给她看看

428
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:53,960
It's on me.
在身上

429
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,440
Did you bring it?
带没带呀？

430
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,080
Wasn't it with you just now?
刚才不是还在你那吗？

431
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,160
It's with you.
在你那

432
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,480
Just check it quickly.
妳就快点查吧

433
00:22:01,560 --> 00:22:02,640
Once Captain Ma flashes his badge...
一会马队一亮证

434
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:05,160
...even your funeral home director will have to come out in person to greet him, got it?
你们殡仪馆馆长 都得亲自出来接待，知道不？

435
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,920
The current police chief was promoted by him!
现在的公安局长是他提拔的

436
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,400
In your back pocket, for sure.
在屁兜上，肯定的

437
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:09,480
No back pocket.
没屁兜

438
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:10,840
Alright... stop digging.
行了…别翻了

439
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:12,080
Found it. There's a record here.
我查着了，这有纪录

440
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:14,200
Claimed by a relative.
领取人是亲属

441
00:22:14,280 --> 00:22:16,240
Registered under the name Shen Dongliang.
登记名是沉栋梁

442
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:22,920
When was it claimed?
啥时候领走的？

443
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:29,840
(Changsong Gardens)
（长松园）

444
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:36,120
Here.
来

445
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,320
Ten yuan.
十块钱

446
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:39,320
Give me a receipt.
开个票

447
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:41,200
Issue one for last time too.
把上回那个也给我开了

448
00:22:41,800 --> 00:22:43,160
What last time?
啥上回啊？

449
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,520
I came by a couple of days ago.
头两天我来过一次

450
00:22:44,600 --> 00:22:46,240
Paid, but forgot to get the receipt.
交钱了，忘开票了

451
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:47,880
What date was that?
几号来的呀？

452
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:49,120
Forgot the exact date.
几号忘了

453
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:51,800
Look up plate Hua-AW357F.
你查查桦AW357F

454
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:52,960
Right here.
这呢

455
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:55,800
Wait, this receipt was already issued to you.
不对啊，这票给你开过了

456
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:57,360
Really?
是吗？

457
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,560
See right here.
这啊

458
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,640
Then give me this copy.
那你这票给我呀

459
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:04,160
Pretty meticulous, huh.
还挺严谨的

460
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:15,080
What are we having for lunch?
咱中午吃点啥呀？

461
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,920
You two pick, my treat.
你俩挑吧，我请客

462
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,280
Then let's eat something good.
那就吃点好的吧

463
00:23:19,360 --> 00:23:21,240
Once we're full this time, keep a sharp stakeout for me.
这回吃饱了，都给我好好蹲守啊

464
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:34,000
When we get inside later, neither of you say a word.
一会要是进了屋啊，你们俩都别插嘴

465
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:35,760
I'll do all the asking.
主要我问

466
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,160
Take it easy.
你悠着点吧

467
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,520
Don't go pulling a muscle again.
你再扯着裆

468
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:44,920
Who's in better shape...
这谁身体好啊

469
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,640
...becomes clear as day when you compare.
一比就比出来了

470
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,040
Give me a break.
你可拉倒吧

471
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,880
You're just full of hot air after overeating.
你那就吃多了撑的

472
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:55,360
Why is she throwing such a huge temper?
这怎么生这么大气呀这是？

473
00:23:57,760 --> 00:24:00,040
Brother-in-law, no wonder she's angry.
姐夫啊，难怪人生气

474
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:03,120
You basically chatter aimlessly without knowing how to talk to women.
就你基本属于那个不会聊瞎聊

475
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:05,560
You completely botched the conversation.
那嗑让你给唠得稀碎

476
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:08,000
You're lucky she didn't smash a thermos over your head.
人没拿暖瓶砸你算你运气好

477
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:12,320
One widowed, one on the verge of divorce.
一个丧偶，一个快离了

478
00:24:12,800 --> 00:24:15,520
Don't try lecturing me on romantic relationships!
在感情这方面就别给我上课了啊

479
00:24:16,080 --> 00:24:17,440
Women...
这女人吧

480
00:24:17,520 --> 00:24:19,640
...especially women of a certain age...
尤其是上点年龄的女人

481
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:22,960
You gotta rub her the right way first before bringing up business.
你得先捋毛，毛捋顺了你再说事

482
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:25,440
You have to listen to Old Man Ma on this.
这你得听老马头的

483
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:27,040
He's got heaps of experience in this department.
这方面他老有经验了

484
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:29,440
- I'm not out of breath.
- Come on, Old Man Ma.
-不喘
-来，老马头

485
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:30,960
Watch how I handle it.
你看我怎么捋

486
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,040
A whole string of missed calls.
一串未接

487
00:24:32,120 --> 00:24:32,960
What's this?
这啥呀？

488
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:35,920
Call her right back then.
你再折过去啊

489
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:37,040
Alright, alright...
来，行了…

490
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:38,280
Let me steady you.
我扶着你点

491
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:40,040
Let me see.
你给我看看

492
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,080
Let me take a look...
我看看啊

493
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,840
If you keep calling back now, it's harassment.
你这在过去就是骚扰

494
00:24:48,120 --> 00:24:50,160
You need to send her a text message.
你得给人发个讯息

495
00:24:50,760 --> 00:24:52,000
Say it like this:
这么说啊

496
00:24:52,840 --> 00:24:54,000
"Yun...
“云啊

497
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:57,600
I was wrong, boo-hoo..."
我错了，呜呜”

498
00:24:58,440 --> 00:24:59,680
Add an emoji.
来个表情

499
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:03,560
"I have no right to offer excuses...
“我没有资格跟妳解释

500
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:08,080
I just don't want you to stay mad at me."
我就不想让妳一直生气”

501
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:09,880
Add one more sentence:
加一句

502
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:11,000
"It breaks my heart."
“我会心疼”

503
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:12,920
"It breaks my heart."
“我会心疼”

504
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:13,960
We've got a true master here!
高手在这呢

505
00:25:16,520 --> 00:25:18,400
"Give me a chance tonight...
“晚上给我个机会

506
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:21,800
...to take you out for dinner...
请妳吃个饭

507
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:25,200
...and apologize to you in person."
当面向妳请罪”

508
00:25:25,880 --> 00:25:26,840
See, hit send?
你看，发不发？

509
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:27,800
Sent.
发了

510
00:25:28,560 --> 00:25:29,760
Get ready to get chewed out.
等着挨怼吧

511
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:31,880
Good luck.
加油

512
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:33,680
See, all that square dancing paid off!
广场舞没白跳吧

513
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:35,720
I'll tell you two one more time:
我再跟你俩说一次啊

514
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:37,960
It's not square dancing, it's Latin dance!
不是广场舞，拉丁啊

515
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:42,600
- Get down... don't look...
- Is it them?
-下来…别瞅…
-是不是啊？

516
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:44,160
- What are you running for?
- Biaozi...
-跑啥呀？
-彪子…

517
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:47,880
Relax, it's nothing.
放松点，没事

518
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,240
They entered the hallway.
进楼道了

519
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,480
Alright.
行

520
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:58,040
- Hurry.
- Okay.
-快
-好

521
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:11,040
This is the one.
是这家

522
00:26:11,560 --> 00:26:12,640
Right here.
就这家

523
00:26:16,560 --> 00:26:19,360
Knock! What are you waiting for? Waiting to be served?
敲啊，等啥呢？ 等上菜呢？

524
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,600
Anyone home?
屋里有人吗？

525
00:26:27,560 --> 00:26:28,760
Hello.
你好

526
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:30,360
We're from Property Management.
我是物业的

527
00:26:31,120 --> 00:26:33,120
Downstairs reported a leak coming from your place.
楼下反映你们家漏水了

528
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,840
We came over to inspect and repair.
我们过来检修一下

529
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:36,480
Please cooperate.
请你们配合

530
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:41,040
Knock!
敲啊

531
00:26:42,800 --> 00:26:44,080
Open up, Property Management!
开门，物业的

532
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:46,320
Is it this unit? Are you sure you got it right?
是这屋吗？ 整明白了吗？

533
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:47,240
Just knock when I tell you to.
让你敲你就敲

534
00:26:47,320 --> 00:26:48,840
Young man, you've got the wrong door.
小伙子，敲错了

535
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:50,720
Over here, I'm the one who called.
这边，我打的电话

536
00:26:52,560 --> 00:26:54,280
No mistake, it's this unit.
没错，就这家

537
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:57,280
Then after you finish fixing theirs...
那等你们给他们修完了

538
00:26:57,360 --> 00:26:58,920
...could you come fix mine?
能不能上我家修修？

539
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:00,320
I can wait a bit.
我等会也行

540
00:27:03,840 --> 00:27:05,160
What's broken at your place?
你们家哪坏了？

541
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:06,760
The kitchen pipe is leaking.
厨房水管漏了

542
00:27:08,320 --> 00:27:10,440
Go back inside then, someone will be there shortly.
那妳回去吧，一会人就来了

543
00:27:10,520 --> 00:27:12,040
I can just wait right here.
我就在这等着也行

544
00:27:17,920 --> 00:27:19,160
Do you know how to fix it?
你会修吗？

545
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:22,080
I suppose I do.
那就会吧

546
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:33,240
Can you figure it out?
能整明白吗？

547
00:27:33,320 --> 00:27:35,040
Is this harder to repair than a train locomotive?
这比火车还难修啊？

548
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:59,560
So it was your place that had the leak?
原来是你们家漏水了呀？

549
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,760
We really got the wrong door.
还真整错了

550
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:04,200
Do you know this neighbor? Is their surname Shen?
妳认识这家吗？ 是姓沉吗？

551
00:28:15,040 --> 00:28:15,920
Here, phone light.
来，手机

552
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:17,280
Shine it here.
照亮，来

553
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:25,640
If you can't figure it out, let's bail.
整不明白撤吧

554
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:27,080
Stop showing off.
别逞能了

555
00:28:30,800 --> 00:28:32,600
Hey, mister, come on inside.
那人，你进来吧

556
00:28:34,080 --> 00:28:35,240
It's cool in here.
这凉快

557
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,800
The two of them can handle this small job.
这点活他俩就能干

558
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:40,720
It's completely ruined.
这完蛋了

559
00:28:40,800 --> 00:28:42,000
Ruined?
完蛋了？

560
00:28:44,240 --> 00:28:45,480
Ma'am...
大姐呀

561
00:28:45,560 --> 00:28:46,960
This fixture is loose.
这玩意松了

562
00:28:47,520 --> 00:28:49,160
It leaks no matter how you tighten it.
怎么拧都漏水

563
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:50,800
What should we do then?
那怎么办呢？

564
00:28:51,360 --> 00:28:52,720
Where's the main shut-off valve?
总阀在哪呢？

565
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:54,160
On the sixth floor...
在六楼…

566
00:28:54,240 --> 00:28:55,280
Do this:
妳这样啊

567
00:28:55,360 --> 00:28:57,560
I'll go shut off the main valve.
我去把那个总阀给它关上

568
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:59,000
First make sure it stops leaking.
首先保证不漏水

569
00:28:59,080 --> 00:29:02,000
Then buy a small valve, install it, and you'll be set.
完了买个小阀，把它安上就妥了啊

570
00:29:02,680 --> 00:29:04,440
This is Master Biao here.
这是那个彪师傅

571
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:06,360
Find a few dry rags...
妳找几块干抹布

572
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:09,520
...and let him mop the floor clean from inside to out.
让他从里到外把地擦干净的

573
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:11,760
What mop the floor clean?
我擦啥干净的我呀？

574
00:29:11,840 --> 00:29:12,840
I don't even do housework at my own home!
我在家我都不干活

575
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:14,920
Did I come here to do manual labor for you?
我跑这跟你干活来了啊？

576
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:19,440
Ma'am, do you live all by yourself?
不是，大姨，妳家就妳一个人呀？

577
00:29:19,520 --> 00:29:20,360
Where are your kids?
子女呢？

578
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,600
Living out of town.
在外地呢

579
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:25,760
Get me a few dry rags then.
妳给我整几块干抹布吧

580
00:29:25,840 --> 00:29:26,720
Okay.
好

581
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:29,720
What's the point of raising kids?
你说养孩子那玩意有啥用

582
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:30,840
Better off raising pigeons.
还不如养鸽子呢

583
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:33,200
Or even raising a dog.
养狗也行

584
00:30:22,800 --> 00:30:24,120
Don't just stand there like a pole.
你别杵那了

585
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,920
Come give me a hand!
过来搭把手啊

586
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,440
Where's all that energy you had downstairs?
刚才楼下那劲头呢？

587
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,120
Quit yapping.
别叭叭了

588
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:30,880
Get to work, quick!
赶紧干啊

589
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:34,360
Spending all your energy in the wrong places every day.
一天那劲用不到正地方

590
00:30:35,040 --> 00:30:36,520
Room 305, right?
305是不？

591
00:30:36,600 --> 00:30:38,000
Yeah, over at 305.
对，305那边

592
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:44,080
Conscience kicked in?
良心发现了？

593
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,320
Rag.
布

594
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:46,480
Give me one.
来一块

595
00:30:48,280 --> 00:30:49,480
Wring it into this basin.
往这盆里整

596
00:30:50,120 --> 00:30:51,560
Your unit reported a broken pipe, right?
你家报修水管是吧？

597
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:54,360
It's all fixed. What took you so long?
都弄好了，怎么才来呢？

598
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:55,280
Thank you!
谢谢啊

599
00:30:56,160 --> 00:30:57,360
Who are you two?
你俩谁呀？

600
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:00,400
We're from Property Management.
我俩物业的

601
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,880
Aren't we Property Management?
这不物业的吗？

602
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,000
Fine, you guys handle it.
行，你们弄吧

603
00:31:03,080 --> 00:31:04,440
- Hold on...
- Who are you two?
-等会
-你俩谁呀？

604
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:07,880
Hello.
你好

605
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,520
We're also from Property Management.
我们也是物业的

606
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:10,600
Do you know them?
你认识吗？

607
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:14,080
If you two are Property Management, then who are we?
你们俩物业的，那我们俩谁呀？

608
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:16,240
- We're new hires.
- Wait... hold on a second.
-新来的
-不是…先等一下

609
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:17,840
New hires?
新来的？

610
00:31:18,560 --> 00:31:20,520
You look like you're pushin' 60!
这我看你得有60了吧

611
00:31:21,040 --> 00:31:21,960
Re-hired after retirement?
返聘呢？

612
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:23,320
Hey, watch your mouth!
不是，你怎么说话呢？

613
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,920
Mind your manners.
注意点分寸啊

614
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:26,760
Ma'am, check if any of your belongings are missing.
阿姨，看看东西丢没

615
00:31:26,840 --> 00:31:29,320
Lately there are scammers in our complex targeting seniors.
最近咱小区有几个骗子专门骗老人

616
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,680
Multiple cases already, I'm telling you.
好几起了，我告诉妳

617
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:32,000
Seeing how old you guys are...
我这看你都老大不小的了

618
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:33,960
...how can you team up to scam an elderly person's money?
怎么能合伙骗老人家钱呢？

619
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:34,960
Who scammed money?
谁骗钱了？

620
00:31:35,040 --> 00:31:36,400
How dare you talk like that?
你怎么说话呢？

621
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,720
- Stop fighting...
- Do you know who he is?
-吵…
-你知道他谁不？

622
00:31:37,800 --> 00:31:38,800
Fine... don't say another word.
行…别说了

623
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:39,760
Truth be told...
实话实说

624
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:41,440
...we're police officers, here on a case.
我们警察，来办案的

625
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:43,760
Why didn't you say you're Emperor Kangxi...
你怎么没说你是康熙呢？

626
00:31:43,840 --> 00:31:45,000
...out inspecting in disguise?
来微服私访的呢？

627
00:31:45,080 --> 00:31:46,080
What's that supposed to mean?
你啥意思啊你？

628
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:48,280
Nothing. Come back to the Property Management office with us and clear this up.
没啥意思，跟我回物业把事情说清楚

629
00:31:48,360 --> 00:31:49,200
Don't get physical!
别上手啊

630
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,040
- What's with this attitude?
- Are you crazy?
-什么态度呢？
-你有病吧？

631
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:52,720
- So what if you're Property Management?
- Don't be impulsive!
-物业的怎么的了？
-别冲动

632
00:31:52,800 --> 00:31:54,640
- Property Management?
- What's going on here?
-物业的？
-怎么的啦这是？

633
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:56,040
- What are you trying to do?
- Then I'm calling the police.
-要干啥？
-那我报警

634
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:57,200
- I'm calling the police!
- Call them then... you think I'm scared?
-我报警
-你报…我怕你？

635
00:31:57,280 --> 00:31:58,160
- Fine, calling the police!
- Go ahead and call!
-好，我报警
-你报警

636
00:31:58,240 --> 00:31:59,520
No need to call, I'll go with you.
不用报，我跟你们走

637
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:01,040
- Let go of me!
- You let go of me!
-你给我撒开
-你给我撒开

638
00:32:01,120 --> 00:32:02,800
- You let go!
- Alright, everybody let go.
-你撒
-行，都撒开

639
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:04,880
- How about my leaking pipe?
- What kind of attitude is this?
-我这水管怎么整啊？
-什么态度啊？

640
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:07,360
Fix her water pipe properly first!
给人把水管修好了

641
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,760
Don't you know what we came here to do?
不知道自己来干啥的？

642
00:32:08,840 --> 00:32:10,200
- Let's go.
- You take him back first.
-走
-你先带他回去

643
00:32:10,280 --> 00:32:11,480
What took you so long earlier?
早干啥去了？

644
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:12,400
The work was almost finished.
活都快干完了

645
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,840
Let's... let me go.
走…走了

646
00:32:13,920 --> 00:32:15,640
Don't push me, I can walk myself.
你别推我，我自己能走

647
00:32:15,720 --> 00:32:18,120
- When told to move, move!
- Tough talker on your home turf.
-让你走你就走
-炕头上能耐

648
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:19,320
Would it kill you to keep your mouth shut for once?
少说两句能死啊？

649
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:20,280
I'd go crazy.
能疯

650
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:22,480
If you hadn't pulled this mess today, would we be in this spot?
这不是你今天整这破事，能这样啊？

651
00:32:22,560 --> 00:32:23,560
If that kid hadn't held me back...
那小子他不拦着我

652
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:25,240
...I tell you, I would've beaten him to a pulp.
我跟你说我脾气废了他

653
00:32:25,320 --> 00:32:26,320
I...
我…

654
00:33:10,600 --> 00:33:11,680
Anyone here?
有人吗？

655
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:17,360
Is anyone home?
有没有人？

656
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:38,160
What happened to you?
妳怎么的了？

657
00:33:57,680 --> 00:33:58,760
Feeling any better?
好点没？

658
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:18,000
This...
这…

659
00:34:46,279 --> 00:34:47,480
You two again?
又是你们俩呀？

660
00:34:51,759 --> 00:34:53,279
What happened to him?
怎么了他这是？

661
00:34:53,799 --> 00:34:56,319
Seasonal nausea—scared half to death.
季节性反胃，被吓的

662
00:34:57,279 --> 00:34:58,200
Come over here.
过来吧

663
00:34:58,799 --> 00:34:59,799
Calling you.
叫你呢

664
00:35:00,680 --> 00:35:02,120
- Me?
- Yes.
-我？
-对

665
00:35:03,799 --> 00:35:05,359
Don't hand that to me!
你别给我呀

666
00:35:08,839 --> 00:35:09,680
Just throw it.
扔一下

667
00:35:15,520 --> 00:35:16,480
Name?
姓名？

668
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:18,240
Wang Xiang.
王响

669
00:35:18,759 --> 00:35:20,120
"Xiang" as in "resounding".
“响亮”的“响”

670
00:35:56,640 --> 00:35:57,760
You went in by yourself?
就你自个进去的？

671
00:35:57,840 --> 00:36:00,600
Right, weren't the two of them taken away by property management?
对，他俩不是被物业带走了吗？

672
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:02,800
(Qiaoyun)
（巧云）

673
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,720
My phone's ringing, can I answer it?
我来电话了，能不能接一下？

674
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:11,440
What do you think?
你觉着呢？

675
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,600
Officer...
警察同志

676
00:36:14,440 --> 00:36:15,840
...just let him take the call.
你就让他接吧

677
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:18,080
It's not easy for seniors to find love.
老年人搞个对象不容易

678
00:36:18,160 --> 00:36:19,360
Did anyone tell you to talk?
让你说话了吗？

679
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,800
Sit straight.
你坐好了

680
00:36:21,520 --> 00:36:24,520
In a moment we'll talk about you impersonating police and scamming.
一会再聊你们冒充警察诈骗的事

681
00:36:24,600 --> 00:36:26,200
Read this statement yourself to see if it's accurate.
你自己看看这个笔录属不属实

682
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:28,280
If there are no issues, you can sign.
如果没什么问题就可以签字了

683
00:36:29,560 --> 00:36:32,080
Didn't that bureau chief carry your bag back in the day?
这局长不当年给你拎过包吗？

684
00:36:32,160 --> 00:36:33,600
Drop his name to them!
跟他们提提人啊

685
00:36:33,680 --> 00:36:35,240
If you're so capability, go say it yourself.
你厉害你说去

686
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:36,680
Dropping the ball when it matters most.
关键时候掉链子

687
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:38,200
Can't afford the embarrassment.
丢不起这人

688
00:36:40,040 --> 00:36:41,080
Nothing serious.
没啥事

689
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:55,080
Bring that guy in the back inside for me.
把那个最里边那人给我叫进来

690
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:03,240
Come out for a moment.
你出来一下

691
00:37:04,600 --> 00:37:05,720
Calling you.
叫你呢

692
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:15,640
Drop his name!
提提人啊

693
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,240
Look at this big desk.
你看这大桌子

694
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:34,960
Way more impressive than back then.
比那会可气派多了啊

695
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:38,400
Have a seat, Captain Ma.
坐吧，马队

696
00:37:40,080 --> 00:37:41,080
Extra handsome.
特帅

697
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,600
What's the situation?
啥情况呀？

698
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:51,320
You and the two outside...
你还有外面那俩

699
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:52,960
...what are you trying to do?
想干啥呀？

700
00:37:55,600 --> 00:37:58,960
Impersonating property management, trespassing into private homes, tampering with crime scenes...
假扮物业，私闯民宅，破坏现场

701
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:01,480
Playing *Mission: Impossible*?
《不可能的任务》啊？

702
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:09,680
Didn't we investigate our way right here?
这不也是查到这了吗？

703
00:38:10,240 --> 00:38:11,520
Why are you getting so worked up?
你还上火了？

704
00:38:12,080 --> 00:38:13,440
How could I not get worked up?
怎么不上火呢？

705
00:38:14,680 --> 00:38:15,960
What are you even investigating?
你查啥呀？

706
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,680
What kind of criminal could you guys catch?
啥罪犯能让你们查着呀？

707
00:38:19,720 --> 00:38:22,680
If you guys solve it all, should we cops just sit around twiddling our thumbs?
都让你们查着了，我们吃干饭吧

708
00:38:23,680 --> 00:38:24,920
Is that what you mean?
是这个意思吗？

709
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:27,760
Weren't we trying to untangle a lead to hand over to you?
这不是想捋出个线头来，交给你吗？

710
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:29,080
Well, thank you so much!
我谢谢你啊

711
00:38:33,560 --> 00:38:35,760
Do you want to investigate Shen Dongliang?
你是不是想查沉栋梁？

712
00:38:39,560 --> 00:38:42,360
18 years ago, union official at Songhe Textile Factory No. 2.
18年前松河纺织二厂的工会干部

713
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:44,720
Shen Mo's uncle.
沈墨的亲大爷

714
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:46,440
And effectively her adoptive father.
也算是她的养父

715
00:38:47,640 --> 00:38:50,880
The hit-and-run driver with cloned plates is his son, Shen Hui.
肇事逃逸的套牌车司机 就是他儿子沉辉

716
00:38:51,720 --> 00:38:53,200
What else did you find out?
还查着啥了？

717
00:38:57,120 --> 00:38:59,040
Didn't I tell you last time?
我上次不跟你说过了吗？

718
00:39:00,400 --> 00:39:02,680
Even if I found out something, I couldn't tell you.
我查着啥，我也不能告诉你呀

719
00:39:05,560 --> 00:39:08,880
Let you old gents keep shining in your golden years?
接着让你们老几位发挥余热去啊？

720
00:39:11,800 --> 00:39:12,960
Look at the three of you.
你说你们仨

721
00:39:13,640 --> 00:39:15,240
What if something happens to you?
出点啥事怎么办呢？

722
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,680
How do we clean up the mess?
怎么收场？

723
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:19,200
How do I answer to your families?
我怎么跟你们家属交代？

724
00:39:21,600 --> 00:39:22,960
You're throwing off the rhythm of our investigation.
你们打乱我们的侦破节奏

725
00:39:23,040 --> 00:39:24,640
How do you answer to me?
你怎么向我交代？

726
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:35,560
Haven't even said anything...
这啥也没说呢

727
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:38,800
...and you're already flying off the handle.
就激动上了

728
00:39:38,880 --> 00:39:39,920
Fine.
好

729
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:41,040
Chief Li.
李局

730
00:39:41,120 --> 00:39:42,960
Don't... don't call me Chief Li.
别…别李局

731
00:39:44,240 --> 00:39:45,480
Xiao Li.
小李

732
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:50,920
Captain Ma.
马队

733
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:55,720
I have just one request for you.
我就拜托你一件事

734
00:39:59,720 --> 00:40:00,920
What request?
什么事？

735
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:04,080
Stop causing trouble.
别捣乱

736
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:51,800
How did it go? Did you drop his name?
怎么样啊？ 提人没？

737
00:40:53,080 --> 00:40:54,280
What did he say?
怎么说的？

738
00:40:57,160 --> 00:40:58,400
Didn't say much.
没说啥

739
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:00,720
Just casual chitchat.
就随便瞎聊聊嘛

740
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:03,040
Just wait and see.
等着吧

741
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:39,920
Coming this late, really.
这么晚才来，真是

742
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:56,680
Heading out?
要出去啊？

743
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:58,040
No.
没有啊

744
00:41:58,120 --> 00:42:00,040
Teacher Wu, why are you coming over so late?
吴老师，你怎么这么晚过来了？

745
00:42:00,600 --> 00:42:02,160
My lower back started acting up again today.
今天这腰又闹起来了

746
00:42:02,240 --> 00:42:03,360
Hurting badly.
疼得厉害

747
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:05,040
Is it convenient?
方不方便？

748
00:42:05,680 --> 00:42:06,800
Sure...
方便…

749
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:08,000
Come on in.
你进来吧

750
00:42:09,480 --> 00:42:10,720
Brought you some mandarins.
给妳带点橘子

751
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:13,160
Thank you.
谢谢啊

752
00:42:13,240 --> 00:42:14,160
No problem...
没事…

753
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:20,640
You haven't eaten yet, right?
妳还没吃饭吧？

754
00:42:22,240 --> 00:42:23,200
Not yet.
没吃呢

755
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:24,920
Neither have I.
我也没吃呢

756
00:42:25,560 --> 00:42:27,160
Got takeout from the wonton shop.
从馄饨店打包了点

757
00:42:27,240 --> 00:42:28,600
Thought I'd eat at home.
寻思回家吃

758
00:42:28,680 --> 00:42:30,480
Packed too much by mistake—two orders.
一包给包多了，两盒

759
00:42:31,040 --> 00:42:33,440
Want to eat together?
要不一起吃？

760
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:36,720
We can do the massage after eating.
吃完了再按

761
00:42:38,080 --> 00:42:39,960
Alright, after we eat.
行，吃完了再按

762
00:42:40,040 --> 00:42:41,280
Here, have a seat inside.
来，你里边坐

763
00:42:49,600 --> 00:42:50,960
This one has cilantro.
这份有香菜

764
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:53,640
This one doesn't.
这份没有

765
00:42:54,120 --> 00:42:56,000
I remembered you don't eat cilantro, right?
我记得妳是不吃香菜是吧？

766
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:58,440
I don't eat cilantro.
我不吃香菜

767
00:42:58,520 --> 00:42:59,760
Isn't that perfect timing?
这不巧了吗？

768
00:43:01,600 --> 00:43:02,520
Here.
来

769
00:43:06,680 --> 00:43:07,520
Here.
来

770
00:43:07,600 --> 00:43:08,440
Thanks.
好

771
00:43:09,520 --> 00:43:10,640
Dig in.
吃吧

772
00:43:16,560 --> 00:43:17,880
Is it still hot?
还热乎吗？

773
00:43:38,840 --> 00:43:40,400
Captain Ma...
马队…

774
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:43,560
Then...
那…

775
00:43:44,680 --> 00:43:46,880
...what's our next step?
下一步咱们怎么办呢？

776
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:49,240
Next step? Leave it to the police.
怎么办？ 交给警察吧

777
00:43:49,320 --> 00:43:50,600
They will give us an answer.
人家会给交代的

778
00:43:51,760 --> 00:43:52,800
I'm off.
走了

779
00:43:53,960 --> 00:43:55,240
Where are you going, Captain Ma?
上哪啊，马队？

780
00:43:55,320 --> 00:43:56,200
